msgid "Upload a complete HTML/TXT file like an AI-generated page, or a ZIP with index.html and its assets."
msgstr "上传完整的 HTML/TXT 单文件页面，或上传包含 index.html 和资源文件的 ZIP。"
msgid "Choose ZIP, HTML, HTM, or TXT"
msgstr "选择 ZIP、HTML、HTM 或 TXT"
msgid "Maximum 25 MB · Single-file pages may contain embedded CSS, JavaScript, and base64 images"
msgstr "最大 25 MB · 单文件页面可包含内嵌 CSS、JavaScript 和 base64 图片"
msgid "Uploaded code"
msgstr "已上传的代码"
msgid "Read-only source for the current version."
msgstr "当前版本的只读源代码。"
